1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,240
No… What are you doing?

4
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:47,440
It was so many years ago.
Nothing worth seeing.

5
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:49,000
Why do you insist?

6
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:52,680
She used to work right here.

7
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:57,960
Children, take a break if you're tired.

8
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,960
Take it easy.

9
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:03,720
If I hadn't taken pity on her,
who would've taken in a child?

10
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:06,880
She could barely do any work
and wasted so much of my food.

11
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:09,479
While she lived here,
she was well fed and warmly clothed.

12
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,720
She had it good here.

13
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,640
For our…

14
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:12,880
Please, don't!

15
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:15,640
Your Liu family is notorious
for being stingy.

16
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,640
You hire half-grown children
to save on wages.

17
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,640
Expect me to believe you?

18
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,320
If you still won't tell the truth,

19
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,760
when I get it out of someone else,
I'll sever the tendons in your hands.

20
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:28,160
Please spare me. The truth is,

21
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,680
she only worked here for a year.

22
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:33,280
She usually slept right there.

23
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,680
You mistreated an eight-year-old child.

24
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,040
Are you even human?

25
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,040
If I hadn't taken her in,

26
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,000
that little bag of bones

27
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,800
would've been buried
in some weed-choked grave!

28
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,240
She should be thanking me!

29
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:52,480
- If you don't believe me, I'll show you.
- Lead the way!

30
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:57,600
Thank you, My lord…

31
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,640
Thank you, my dear.

32
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,760
My Lady, really.

33
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,720
You could've had them inspect the cellar.
Why go down there yourself?

34
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,280
Pitiable as the refugees are,

35
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,880
yet many among them
who are lazy and shifty.

36
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:28,160
This cellar will hold food
for the whole winter.

37
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,000
- I have to inspect it myself.
- Coming.

38
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,560
All this just to survive?

39
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,560
Why push yourself this far?

40
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,280
I've already promised you…

41
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,920
I can't rely entirely
on you to protect me.

42
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,760
You can't be by my side every moment.

43
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,680
It's done.

44
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:47,640
Besides,

45
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,960
winters are bitterly cold.

46
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,760
People freeze to death every year.

47
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,080
You don't know what
it's like to starve and freeze.

48
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,880
Careful. Take it slow.

49
00:03:56,960 --> 00:04:01,680
One extra wheat cake
could saved one more life.

50
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,720
Don't think too highly of me.

51
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:15,600
These people
are the foundation of my position.

52
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:19,600
Come on. I'll take you up the mountain.

53
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,320
General Qi's trap caught a wild boar.

54
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,520
Slow down.

55
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,720
Let's go. Up the mountain.

56
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:43,960
Bandit.

57
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,680
I am a bandit.

58
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,560
You're the only one I'm after.

59
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:49,440
Let's go!

60
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,840
My Lady!

61
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,400
XIANZHUANG

62
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:57,640
To pay off a debt,
her gambling-addict father

63
00:04:58,160 --> 00:05:00,040
removed her from the lacquer workshop

64
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,920
and gave her to that family.

65
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,080
Their 15-year-old son had just died,

66
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,920
and they wanted a young girl's body
to bury with him.

67
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:11,200
How could anyone be so heartless
as to do something so cruel?

68
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,120
What happened to her after?

69
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,800
- Over there!
- No!

70
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:23,040
- No! Don't kill me!
- Still trying to run?

71
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:24,760
No!

72
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,960
<i>At such a young age,</i>

73
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:35,720
<i>she endured the pain</i>
<i>without making a sound.</i>

74
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:40,200
<i>She pretended to be dead</i>
<i>and fooled them all.</i>

75
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:55,640
<i>People at the mill said</i>
<i>that even in the dead of winter,</i>

76
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,040
<i>A-Chou wore only a thin shirt.</i>

77
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:02,360
<i>Her hands and feet</i>
<i>were split open with bloody cracks.</i>

78
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:05,080
<i>They'd heal, then split open again.</i>

79
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,800
<i>She was the youngest,</i>

80
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:09,960
<i>yet she worked from cockcrow</i>
<i>until deep into the night</i>

81
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,000
<i>and was always paid the least</i>

82
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:16,920
<i>because the owner knew</i>
<i>she had nowhere else to go.</i>

83
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,040
<i>Everyone called her Little Mute.</i>

84
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,880
<i>When she first came to the mill,</i>

85
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,800
<i>she could barely speak.</i>

86
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:27,840
- Why couldn't she speak?
- She'd been frightened into silence.

87
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:31,320
But after narrowly escaping death
and spending a year at the mill,

88
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:33,080
her birth father,
Lai Gen, found her again.

89
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:37,080
People told her to run,
but she still went back.

90
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:40,640
Oh, why would she go back?

91
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:43,840
She said her mother was bedridden.

92
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:47,920
If she didn't go back to work,
her younger sister would be sold too.

93
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:56,440
Your aunt really ought
to be here hearing this.

94
00:06:57,640 --> 00:07:02,000
You people
forced that poor girl into all this.

95
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:04,080
You'll pay for what you've done.

96
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:10,120
Is that all you found?
Was there anything else?

97
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,560
It's been so many years.
There are countless leads to follow.

98
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,040
But I've found some clues

99
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:19,680
about those who lived
with her in the tenement.

100
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:23,000
Hurry. You must hurry.

101
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:26,280
Grandmother, pitiful as she may be,
she's still an outsider.

102
00:07:27,200 --> 00:07:30,440
Why are you so concerned
about A-Chou's background?

103
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:34,720
I've already checked. Madam Qiao
kept working even while pregnant

104
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:37,080
and washed clothes by the river every day.

105
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:40,440
The neighbors watched the child
be born and grow up.

106
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:43,360
Her household
registration and age both match.

107
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:45,320
Grandmother,
what are you still suspicious of?

108
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:47,160
I honestly don't know.

109
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:49,840
I just can't shake this uneasiness.

110
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:53,000
Keep investigating. Hurry and dig deeper.

111
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:55,600
All right. I'll keep looking.

112
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,560
Go.

113
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,200
What do you need this for?

114
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:08,520
Aunt Heng'e, don't ask questions.
Just give it to me.

115
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,360
- Jundai…
- I'm not your Jundai!

116
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,960
I'm Wei Rao.

117
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:16,320
My father was a hero
who died on the battlefield.

118
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:20,400
My mother is Lady Li,
His Majesty's most favored consort.

119
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:23,640
I'm the noblest young lady in the capital!

120
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,320
Don't worry, Aunt Heng'e.

121
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,919
It's only a precaution.

122
00:08:56,840 --> 00:09:00,520
KITCHEN

123
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:07,080
- Is that ginseng soup for Grandmother?
- Yes.

124
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,040
I'll take it from here.

125
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,880
You're not needed here. Leave.

126
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:21,200
Household rules require special care
with the Dowager Lady's meals.

127
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,680
I can't leave it unattended
even for a moment.

128
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:35,840
Grandmother,
you haven't had much appetite lately

129
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:37,280
and often complain of fatigue.

130
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:40,320
This ginseng soup
should be taken before your meal

131
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,560
for the best effect.

132
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:44,840
If taken afterward,
its effect is greatly reduced.

133
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:57,480
- Brother Jue?
- Huo Jue, what are you doing?

134
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,960
The kitchen is smoky
from all the charcoal fires.

135
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:01,360
You've always hated it
and never set foot there.

136
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:05,680
Yet today, you personally
brewed Grandmother's ginseng soup.

137
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:06,960
Why is that?

138
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:26,000
What's wrong with doing something
for my grandmother?

139
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,320
Grandmother,

140
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:30,360
I won't stay here
and offend anyone further.

141
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,320
- I'll take my leave.
- My child…

142
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:34,160
Rao!

143
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,080
Grandmother…

144
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,640
She meant well.

145
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:46,120
Seeing that I've barely been eating
and have been coughing up phlegm,

146
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:49,480
she had the maids
brew a strong ginseng soup

147
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:51,680
with bamboo sap and ginger juice added.

148
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:55,120
She meant well.
Why are you so suspicious of her?

149
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,560
Grandmother, I just…

150
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,560
You've been investigating
A-Chou's background every day,

151
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,600
and it's making you
grow suspicious, isn't it?

152
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:06,040
Still, without any evidence,

153
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,720
you shouldn't have shown your suspicions.

154
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,400
It was my fault.

155
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,080
I'll go apologize to her now.

156
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,920
He's still young after all.

157
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:22,040
He can't keep his composure.

158
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:35,320
Young Master.

159
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,360
Rao! Rao! What are you doing?

160
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,880
Rao! Drop it!

161
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:45,880
- Let go of me!
- Give it to me!

162
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,920
- Give it! Drop it!
- Let go of me!

163
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,960
Why do you still care what happens to me?

164
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:53,760
Rao, I'm sorry.

165
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:59,200
You went to investigate A-Chou's past,
to see how miserable and pitiful she was.

166
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,480
You've clearly begun to waver!

167
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,320
Right.

168
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,520
She's the pitiful one
for stealing my place,

169
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:08,840
while I'm the wicked one
though I've lost everything.

170
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:13,280
- That's not true.
- Just because I'm unruly, bad-tempered,

171
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,560
and not as sly and calculating as she is,

172
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:21,240
everyone despises me and speaks ill of me.

173
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:23,720
Even when I try to do
something for Grandmother,

174
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:25,840
you question and suspect me.

175
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,760
I love Grandmother more than anyone.

176
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,520
How could I ever harm her?

177
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:34,880
Everything I do is wrong.

178
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:39,480
Then just let me die
so I never have to offend your eyes again!

179
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,840
Rao,

180
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:44,640
I lost my head for a moment.
I don't know what came over me.

181
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:48,160
I don't even know why
I would have such suspicions.

182
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,920
Ever since Governess Chang died,

183
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,040
you may not have said anything,

184
00:12:55,160 --> 00:12:56,880
but you've been doubting me all along.

185
00:12:57,560 --> 00:13:01,200
She was a deceitful, vicious old woman.
How could you believe her?

186
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:03,920
You suspected me of
poisoning Grandmother, didn't you?

187
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,440
Yes.

188
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,240
I did hide poison under my pillow,

189
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:12,080
but it was meant for me.

190
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:15,040
I'd rather end my own life

191
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:18,640
than be despised by everyone I love!

192
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:21,000
Rao!

193
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,720
Stop it, Rao! Rao!

194
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:30,440
Go get the physician! Hurry!

195
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:32,720
Rao,

196
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:35,600
forgive me. I was wrong.

197
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:40,000
From now on, I'll believe whatever you say
and never doubt you without cause again.

198
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:43,800
Rao!

199
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:48,120
Someone!

200
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,720
Come quickly!

201
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:52,320
ZHAOYANG PALACE

202
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:10,240
All of you, leave.

203
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:17,680
You said Rao tried to take her own life?

204
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:18,600
Don't panic, Your Ladyship.

205
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:21,000
Fortunately, Lord Huo stopped her in time.

206
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,040
She swallowed very little poison.

207
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:24,400
She's been given a licorice
and bean decoction as an antidote.

208
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:26,160
Her internal organs are unharmed.

209
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:41,000
Please calm down, Your Ladyship.

210
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:44,080
This is all my fault.

211
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:47,440
Rao has suffered so much,

212
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,800
yet I still told her to hide and wait.

213
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:58,200
A noble daughter of a great family
forced to live in hiding…

214
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:02,160
She must blame me, her own mother.

215
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:05,120
Where's Madam Qiao?

216
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:08,040
You've searched for so long.
Has she been found yet?

217
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:09,520
Your Ladyship,

218
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:12,680
we've searched every prefecture
and county around the capital.

219
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:15,760
We've also checked the Imperial
Medical Bureau and local clinics.

220
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,240
But we only got word this morning.

221
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,440
Two years ago,

222
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:20,960
the retired Imperial Physician
Wang Zhonglu

223
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:23,400
was best known for
treating wasting illnesses.

224
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:27,240
- Where is he now?
- Yong County.

225
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:30,400
Turn all of Yong County
upside down if you must.

226
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:31,880
Find Madam Qiao and her daughter.

227
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,680
Yes.

228
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:44,840
Take this and give it to Rao.

229
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:48,560
Tell her
I've never forgotten what I promised her.

230
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,520
Tell her to focus on recovering.

231
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:54,760
Once she's well enough to get out of bed,

232
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:59,600
I will have her back and make them pay.

233
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:04,200
RADIANT BEAUTY, RARE GRACE

234
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,400
<i>A-Chou, oh A-Chou.</i>

235
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:18,280
<i>You forced me to become like a stray dog,</i>
<i>wagging my tail and begging for mercy.</i>

236
00:16:19,040 --> 00:16:21,160
<i>Even if I descend to the underworld,</i>

237
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:23,720
<i>I won't go alone.</i>

238
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:27,600
<i>I'll drag you down with me.</i>

239
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:32,920
Missed.

240
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:35,520
Archery takes time to master.

241
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,640
Don't rush.

242
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:38,360
Here.

243
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,760
I spend days in the barracks.

244
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,960
I'm rough by nature, lacking formalities.

245
00:16:57,600 --> 00:17:00,720
If I've overstepped any boundaries,
please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

246
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:02,080
The army has been busy lately,

247
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,960
so I may not be able
to come for some time.

248
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:07,760
If you want to learn archery,
I know a woman archer.

249
00:17:07,839 --> 00:17:09,280
I'll have her teach you instead.
That would be more appropriate.

250
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:12,040
Thank you, General.
I was thinking the same thing.

251
00:17:14,359 --> 00:17:15,680
Come see how the training is going.

252
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,440
They're finally starting to shape up.

253
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,359
- Are you all right?
- Unacceptable!

254
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:27,319
Whose child behaves so poorly?

255
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:29,200
The training ground
is no place to run around!

256
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,880
Forgive us, Your Ladyship!

257
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,480
That careless fool.

258
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:35,880
Your Ladyship,

259
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:38,400
her husband broke his leg
while hunting in the mountains.

260
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:39,920
The family had no way to make a living,

261
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,920
so we let her stay
and do laundry for the estate.

262
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:44,000
Hurry and apologize!

263
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:45,440
Forgive me, Your Ladyship.

264
00:17:45,520 --> 00:17:47,000
Blades have no eyes.

265
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:49,120
Watch the child. Don't let him get hurt.

266
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,240
Bitao.

267
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,040
Try some.

268
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:07,480
You're far too noble
for this, Your Ladyship.

269
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:09,680
It's an honor for them.
Quick, kowtow to Her Ladyship!

270
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:11,200
No need.

271
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:14,280
These two children…

272
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:16,160
Oh, they're twins.

273
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:17,840
Quite an adorable pair.

274
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:21,400
Don't be afraid.
It's a gift from Her Ladyship.

275
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:22,520
Just accept it.

276
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:26,280
Here, take them all.

277
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:30,280
- Come on.
- Hurry. Let's go.

278
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:32,040
Don't come running in here again.

279
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:34,080
General Qi,

280
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:39,160
in this world,
can two people really look so alike?

281
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:42,800
Women carrying twins have often seen

282
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:43,760
both mother and child lost.

283
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:48,240
That's why twins are rare.
Rare, but not unheard of.

284
00:18:48,320 --> 00:18:49,520
Those two just now
were twins, weren't they?

285
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:50,440
What if they aren't twins?

286
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:53,200
If two people are
neither kin nor connected,

287
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:54,720
yet happen to look alike,

288
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:57,560
then it's fate playing tricks,
a coincidence.

289
00:18:58,440 --> 00:18:59,440
Fate?

290
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:03,600
Could fate really
arrange such a coincidence?

291
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:09,800
Two complete strangers
who aren't related by blood at all…

292
00:19:13,120 --> 00:19:14,240
How could they look so alike?

293
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:17,800
Why?

294
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:21,600
Your Ladyship,

295
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,880
one of Lady Li's attendants
is heading toward Yong County.

296
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:34,840
General Qi,
I need the men you've been training.

297
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:37,480
They've only trained for a few days.

298
00:19:37,560 --> 00:19:39,360
They may look orderly,
but they're full of weaknesses.

299
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:41,760
Against a well-trained army,

300
00:19:41,840 --> 00:19:44,640
they'd be swept aside,
unable to even put up a fight.

301
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:47,400
If you need a hand,
I'll assign you some others.

302
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:49,520
No. I can't use your men

303
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:51,640
or the Lu family's.

304
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:56,120
Besides, one can only learn
to farm by getting into the field.

305
00:19:58,040 --> 00:19:59,680
What good is training in a drill yard?

306
00:20:00,760 --> 00:20:02,040
They need real experience.

307
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:13,200
Mother!

308
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:20,520
Please! Spare me!

309
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:21,920
I… I've paid off all my gambling debts.

310
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:23,480
- I don't owe a single coin!
- No.

311
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:25,200
- Don't take me.
- General, what's going on?

312
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,800
Mother. Hongxian.

313
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:31,960
You good-for-nothing.
All you do is drink and gamble.

314
00:20:32,040 --> 00:20:33,000
Now look, you've brought them right to us!

315
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:35,720
- Take them all away!
- I'm innocent!

316
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:37,400
I'm innocent!

317
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:39,120
I'm innocent!

318
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:46,120
Who are you people?

319
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:48,400
- Why are you taking us?
- Keep quiet.

320
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:50,640
Settle down and stop causing trouble.

321
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:58,120
Deputy General Zhao,
my stomach's acting up. I need to go!

322
00:20:58,800 --> 00:21:00,720
- Me too.
- I can't hold it either!

323
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:01,560
- What's going on?
- Move!

324
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,720
Pull yourselves together!

325
00:21:02,800 --> 00:21:04,040
It must've been that tea stall we passed.

326
00:21:04,120 --> 00:21:06,360
Someone must've tampered with the tea.

327
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,640
What?

328
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:11,160
‪Go there.

329
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:21,880
Someone's attacking the carriage!
Guards! Guards!

330
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:29,680
‪Don't try anything!

331
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:32,960
We've got them all.

332
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:38,440
- Don't kill me!
- Don't kill me! Please!

333
00:21:38,520 --> 00:21:39,360
- Don't kill me!
- Mother. Hongxian.

334
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:44,880
A-Chou? Mother, A-Chou came to save us!

335
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,920
Your Ladyship, I drugged them all.

336
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:48,440
- Didn't I do a fine job?
- Get down!

337
00:21:48,520 --> 00:21:49,800
You get the greatest credit.

338
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:53,120
For this victory,
every man under my command

339
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:56,000
gets 100 coins and a bolt of silk.

340
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:56,920
From now on,

341
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:58,920
a dou of fine rice and a plate
of meat will be added to every meal!

342
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:01,400
Your Ladyship prevails!

343
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:02,960
Your Ladyship prevails!

344
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:04,920
Your Ladyship prevails!

345
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,240
Your Ladyship prevails!

346
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:11,680
Physician Wang truly works wonders.

347
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:13,160
You look so much better, Mother.

348
00:22:13,800 --> 00:22:14,800
A-Chou,

349
00:22:15,360 --> 00:22:17,720
looking at you now,
I can barely recognize you.

350
00:22:23,080 --> 00:22:24,160
There's so much good food here.

351
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:26,600
How could the two of us finish it all?

352
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:28,080
Why not call your brother and sister over

353
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,960
so the whole family can be together?

354
00:22:31,040 --> 00:22:33,800
They've been frightened half
to death and are covered in dirt.

355
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,040
They're in quite a state.

356
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:37,280
I had someone take them to wash up.

357
00:22:38,280 --> 00:22:39,280
Food will be prepared for them.

358
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:42,840
Your brother loves drinking.
Someone needs to keep an eye on him.

359
00:22:43,720 --> 00:22:46,400
And Hongxian was scared out of her wits.
I'd better go check on them.

360
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:49,560
We haven't seen each other in so long,
yet you haven't even said you missed me.

361
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,760
All you talk about
is Hongxian and Runsheng.

362
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:52,800
You're playing favorites.

363
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:55,440
Are those two
the only ones you care about?

364
00:22:55,520 --> 00:22:56,640
What about me, your daughter?

365
00:22:59,560 --> 00:23:01,160
I think about you every day.

366
00:23:02,120 --> 00:23:05,200
But of my three children,
you're the oldest.

367
00:23:05,880 --> 00:23:09,400
You're smart and sensible,
so I worry about you the least.

368
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:10,680
Those two are different.

369
00:23:10,760 --> 00:23:12,040
The moment I take my eyes
off them, there's trouble.

370
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:14,640
There are so many people
around this estate.

371
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:18,880
I'm just afraid…
afraid they'll cause trouble for you.

372
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,040
Is that so?

373
00:23:28,640 --> 00:23:29,680
My daughter,

374
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:31,680
it's been a while.

375
00:23:31,760 --> 00:23:33,800
You've changed so much.

376
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:36,440
How have I changed?

377
00:23:37,040 --> 00:23:38,360
I can't quite put it into words.

378
00:23:39,080 --> 00:23:41,920
You've become more imposing
and more formidable.

379
00:23:42,840 --> 00:23:46,120
And the way you speak
and act is nothing like before.

380
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:47,600
I'm just a poor old woman.

381
00:23:48,280 --> 00:23:50,160
Even I feel
a little intimidated by you now.

382
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:52,480
I can hardly recognize you.

383
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:57,280
No matter how much I change,
I'll always be your daughter.

384
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:04,840
This…

385
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:07,120
Is someone else joining us?

386
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:12,080
An old acquaintance
wants to catch up with you.

387
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:15,520
The Grand Military Review
takes place once every three years.

388
00:24:15,600 --> 00:24:17,720
Every unit is doing all it can to
distinguish itself before His Majesty.

389
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:19,040
You have trainings
first thing tomorrow morning.

390
00:24:19,120 --> 00:24:21,960
You said you'd stay at the barracks,
yet you came rushing back again.

391
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:25,400
Are you afraid
Her Ladyship might run away?

392
00:24:27,360 --> 00:24:29,240
I spoke out of turn. I deserve this.

393
00:24:29,840 --> 00:24:30,800
Who is that woman?

394
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:42,000
Go find out
who Her Ladyship invited tonight.

395
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:43,600
Yes.

396
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:57,800
It's been a long time.
I hope you've been well.

397
00:24:57,880 --> 00:25:00,280
I pay my respects to Your Ladyship.

398
00:25:02,440 --> 00:25:03,480
Oh my.

399
00:25:04,040 --> 00:25:06,360
How could I let
Your Ladyship serve me wine?

400
00:25:07,640 --> 00:25:09,520
This is too much of an honor for me.

401
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:11,920
How could I forget my roots?

402
00:25:12,560 --> 00:25:14,600
When Han Liao
deliberately stirred up trouble,

403
00:25:15,120 --> 00:25:17,240
if you hadn't acted so cleverly
to help me, Governess Liu,

404
00:25:17,320 --> 00:25:18,400
how could I have everything today?

405
00:25:19,200 --> 00:25:21,360
Afterward, to stay out of trouble,

406
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:24,520
you had to keep hiding
from place to place.

407
00:25:24,600 --> 00:25:26,200
I've always felt guilty about that.

408
00:25:27,280 --> 00:25:29,240
I should have toasted you long ago.

409
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:31,720
Here's to you, Governess Liu.

410
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:38,640
Even a crafty rabbit
has three burrows, doesn't it?

411
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:41,440
With all the money you gave me,
changing my hideout from time to time

412
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:42,640
is no big deal.

413
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:46,080
If you hadn't invite me here,
I wouldn't have shown my face.

414
00:25:46,960 --> 00:25:49,600
I knew from the start
you were destined for greater things.

415
00:25:50,360 --> 00:25:52,800
So all my efforts to cover for you
weren't wasted.

416
00:25:53,840 --> 00:25:55,280
You know how to repay a kindness.

417
00:25:55,960 --> 00:25:57,360
Come on. Let's drink one more bowl!

418
00:26:02,280 --> 00:26:06,280
<i>Wei Rao, what exactly are you planning?</i>

419
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:07,720
Let me toast you again.

420
00:26:10,080 --> 00:26:11,200
Here.

421
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:22,800
Just look at you,
so dignified and elegant.

422
00:26:23,960 --> 00:26:26,640
Madam Qiao, with a daughter like this,

423
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:28,640
you'll enjoy a life of comfort!

424
00:26:29,800 --> 00:26:31,800
Too much to drink
and you start talking nonsense.

425
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:33,840
What if someone overhears you?

426
00:26:33,920 --> 00:26:35,200
Why not take her to bed?

427
00:26:35,280 --> 00:26:37,160
A generous gift tomorrow to thank her.

428
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:41,800
There's no rush.
There are no outsiders here.

429
00:26:43,040 --> 00:26:45,600
What's the harm
in talking a little longer?

430
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:50,840
When I was little,
my father often beat and berated me.

431
00:26:51,360 --> 00:26:53,200
I thought I wouldn't live past eight.

432
00:26:54,360 --> 00:26:55,600
Who'd have thought it'd come to this?

433
00:26:56,840 --> 00:27:01,240
It just shows that no one
can predict what life has in store.

434
00:27:04,040 --> 00:27:05,560
Exactly.

435
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:08,600
That heartless father of yours
abandoned you in the mountains,

436
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:10,880
thinking the wolves would carry you off.

437
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:15,280
"Survive a great calamity,
and better days will come."

438
00:27:15,360 --> 00:27:17,160
That saying came true for you.

439
00:27:20,120 --> 00:27:21,240
That really happened?

440
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:22,840
How come I never knew?

441
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:25,680
You were only two then.

442
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:27,160
How could you remember?

443
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:30,960
That scoundrel lost money gambling

444
00:27:31,800 --> 00:27:32,840
and blamed you for bringing him bad luck.

445
00:27:33,600 --> 00:27:37,520
When I wasn't looking, he secretly
carried you away and abandoned you.

446
00:27:39,400 --> 00:27:41,280
My Lord, keep it down.

447
00:27:41,360 --> 00:27:44,040
That night, your mother
came back from washing clothes.

448
00:27:44,120 --> 00:27:47,120
When she couldn't find you,
she went frantic.

449
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:50,040
She wouldn't listen to any of us

450
00:27:50,120 --> 00:27:53,400
and ran into
the mountains alone to look for you.

451
00:27:54,120 --> 00:27:56,480
A-Chou! A-Chou!

452
00:27:59,360 --> 00:28:00,440
A-Chou!

453
00:28:01,720 --> 00:28:02,760
A-Chou!

454
00:28:06,080 --> 00:28:06,840
A-Chou!

455
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:08,920
Go away!

456
00:28:10,640 --> 00:28:11,880
A-Chou…

457
00:28:24,200 --> 00:28:25,800
In this whole world,

458
00:28:26,320 --> 00:28:32,280
only a mother
would dare fight wolves for her child.

459
00:28:32,360 --> 00:28:35,120
When your mother
came down the mountain the next day,

460
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:39,080
her whole body was covered in wounds.

461
00:28:39,600 --> 00:28:43,360
A wolf even tore
a chunk of flesh from here.

462
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:47,160
But she held you tight
and wouldn't let go.

463
00:28:47,240 --> 00:28:51,360
No one could separate the two of you.

464
00:28:51,440 --> 00:28:56,080
I'll never forget this moment
for the rest of my life.

465
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,800
So these scars on your arm

466
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:19,120
were all because of me.

467
00:29:20,400 --> 00:29:23,920
I thought you didn't care about me,
that you didn't love me.

468
00:29:24,520 --> 00:29:26,200
You did all that for me.

469
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:29,320
Why did you never tell me?

470
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:35,560
I was weak and couldn't protect you.

471
00:29:36,280 --> 00:29:38,320
It was all my fault.

472
00:29:40,120 --> 00:29:41,800
I failed you.

473
00:29:45,080 --> 00:29:46,560
I'm sorry, my child.

474
00:29:47,760 --> 00:29:50,080
I made you suffer so much

475
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:53,000
and shouldered
the burden of this whole family.

476
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:55,960
Even now, we're still dragging you down.

477
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:59,800
It breaks my heart.

478
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:10,400
Why did you never tell me
how much you were suffering inside?

479
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:14,680
I never wanted much.

480
00:30:15,920 --> 00:30:18,000
What you've given me
has always been enough.

481
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:22,440
Governess Liu is drunk.

482
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:25,240
Let me take you back to rest.

483
00:30:25,320 --> 00:30:28,280
You two have a good talk.

484
00:30:28,840 --> 00:30:29,760
What fine wine!

485
00:30:30,280 --> 00:30:33,040
A wolf tore a chunk of flesh right off…

486
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:37,520
Mother,

487
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:40,400
Hongxian said she missed me.

488
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:43,280
I've settled her in the west wing room.

489
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:45,720
Why don't you move there too?

490
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:48,280
I've been traveling for days. I'm tired.

491
00:30:49,120 --> 00:30:50,440
I don't want to keep moving around.

492
00:30:51,480 --> 00:30:52,960
This room is perfectly fine.

493
00:30:54,040 --> 00:30:56,320
You sisters should
spend some time together.

494
00:30:57,520 --> 00:30:58,960
- Okay?
- Sure.

495
00:31:02,760 --> 00:31:04,200
Whatever you say, Mother.

496
00:31:39,360 --> 00:31:40,440
You're back, my dear?

497
00:31:42,280 --> 00:31:43,320
Why are your eyes red?

498
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:47,280
Have you had dinner yet?

499
00:31:47,800 --> 00:31:48,760
I'll have someone prepare it.

500
00:31:50,600 --> 00:31:53,240
Don't bother. His Majesty will inspect
the troops during the winter hunt.

501
00:31:55,720 --> 00:31:58,600
There's still much to do at the barracks.
I'll pack a few things and leave.

502
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:01,600
Then I'll pack for you.

503
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:09,520
Here. Put this on. It's cold at night.

504
00:32:14,760 --> 00:32:17,800
I'm leaving Zhao Song and Zhao Bai here.
If you need anything, just tell them.

505
00:32:19,840 --> 00:32:20,920
Okay, I know.

506
00:32:22,560 --> 00:32:23,440
Good night.

507
00:32:33,800 --> 00:32:35,400
<i>From what she said in there just now,</i>

508
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:38,640
<i>she seems to doubt about her own origins.</i>

509
00:32:41,080 --> 00:32:42,080
My… My Lord,

510
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:45,080
weren't you staying here tonight?
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

511
00:32:45,160 --> 00:32:46,160
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

512
00:32:46,240 --> 00:32:47,560
Go find someone
from the Wei family for me.

513
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:49,000
Who are you looking for at
the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence?

514
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:52,280
No. Not the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

515
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:55,440
Go to the Court of Justice.
I'll go there myself.

516
00:32:57,200 --> 00:33:00,120
My Lord! What are you going to
the Court of Justice for, My Lord?

517
00:33:02,960 --> 00:33:04,120
I was such a fool.

518
00:33:06,320 --> 00:33:08,480
How could I doubt my own mother?

519
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:14,600
If she weren't my birth mother,

520
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:19,240
why would she fight wolves
to save my life?

521
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:23,360
I was so foolish.

522
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:26,120
Your Ladyship,

523
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:29,800
the silkworm house is ready.
You can inspect it when you have time.

524
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:33,360
You said the soldiers
should be divided into three ranks,

525
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:36,400
with different pay and meals for each.

526
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:38,720
Mr. Feng has drafted the regulations.

527
00:33:38,800 --> 00:33:40,960
Once you've reviewed them,
we'll post them.

528
00:33:41,040 --> 00:33:42,680
The fruit tree saplings have arrived too.

529
00:33:42,760 --> 00:33:44,120
It's getting late.

530
00:33:45,360 --> 00:33:47,120
There's plenty to do tomorrow.

531
00:33:48,320 --> 00:33:49,680
You should get some sleep.

532
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:53,280
Yes, it's late.

533
00:33:58,240 --> 00:33:59,480
Time to rest.

534
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,760
Oh, no! Fire!

535
00:34:10,840 --> 00:34:12,320
- Fire!
- Fire!

536
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:14,120
- Put it out!
- Oh, no!

537
00:34:14,199 --> 00:34:17,400
- Put out the fire!
- Hurry!

538
00:34:17,480 --> 00:34:18,400
Help!

539
00:34:18,480 --> 00:34:20,040
Hurry!

540
00:34:20,120 --> 00:34:22,080
Save Her Ladyship! Hurry!

541
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:24,159
Help!

542
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:26,159
Her Ladyship is still inside!

543
00:34:26,239 --> 00:34:28,280
- Her Ladyship's room is on fire!
- Help!

544
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:29,800
- Someone, help!
- Hongxian!

545
00:34:29,880 --> 00:34:30,880
Put out the fire!

546
00:34:30,960 --> 00:34:33,199
- Hongxian!
- Her Ladyship is still inside!

547
00:34:34,159 --> 00:34:35,159
Fire!

548
00:34:36,080 --> 00:34:38,480
- Fire!
- Fire!

549
00:34:38,560 --> 00:34:40,360
Get more water!

550
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:42,480
- Hurry!
- Help!

551
00:34:42,560 --> 00:34:43,760
- Hongxian!
- Help!

552
00:34:44,280 --> 00:34:46,120
- Hongxian!
- Hurry!

553
00:34:46,199 --> 00:34:48,040
- Hongxian!
- Water's here!

554
00:34:48,639 --> 00:34:49,920
Bring the water!

555
00:34:51,120 --> 00:34:51,960
Hongxian!

556
00:34:52,040 --> 00:34:53,320
- Get them out!
- Hurry!

557
00:34:53,960 --> 00:34:55,320
- Hurry!
- Hongxian!

558
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:58,840
- Hurry!
- Get them out!

559
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:00,760
- Someone, help!
- Water's here!

560
00:35:00,840 --> 00:35:02,520
Get them out!

561
00:35:03,120 --> 00:35:03,960
Fire!

562
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:07,360
Fire over here!

563
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:08,920
Get more water!

564
00:35:09,520 --> 00:35:11,560
- Hurry!
- Get more water!

565
00:35:14,160 --> 00:35:15,520
Hurry!

566
00:35:28,080 --> 00:35:29,920
Have you forgotten…

567
00:35:31,920 --> 00:35:33,640
that you have another daughter?

568
00:35:47,120 --> 00:35:48,760
I'm not your daughter.

569
00:35:51,360 --> 00:35:52,720
Then who am I?

570
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,760
Who am I?

571
00:36:08,720 --> 00:36:10,200
That foolish maid

572
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:12,280
knocked over a candlestick on night watch.

573
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:14,360
Luckily, you woke up in time,
so it didn't turn into a disaster.

574
00:36:15,240 --> 00:36:16,720
They were all running around in a panic.

575
00:36:16,800 --> 00:36:17,840
How could anyone
put out the fire like that?

576
00:36:17,920 --> 00:36:19,680
They were only getting in the way.

577
00:36:20,520 --> 00:36:22,960
You got to sort them out.
Don't let it slide.

578
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:24,480
Stop bothering your sister.

579
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:26,160
She's busy.

580
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:27,920
Mother,

581
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:30,360
A-Chou said now that we're in the capital,
we don't need to leave again.

582
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:33,000
We'll live here from now on.

583
00:36:33,080 --> 00:36:36,400
She also said she'd find me a good teacher
to teach me music and dance.

584
00:36:37,280 --> 00:36:39,120
We'll never have to
hide from place to place

585
00:36:39,200 --> 00:36:40,120
or live in fear again.

586
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:44,240
I've always wanted to learn to dance,
but I could never afford the tuition.

587
00:36:45,120 --> 00:36:46,200
- Now A-Chou can…
- Enough!

588
00:36:47,560 --> 00:36:48,400
Stop talking.

589
00:36:53,040 --> 00:36:55,320
Mother's tired.
You should get some rest too.

590
00:37:11,840 --> 00:37:12,760
A-Chou,

591
00:37:14,560 --> 00:37:16,320
I hope you won't be so cruel

592
00:37:17,160 --> 00:37:21,080
as to take revenge on us
once you learn the truth about your birth.

593
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:23,840
I was the only one at fault.

594
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:25,600
Nothing to do with Hongxian and Runsheng.

595
00:37:25,680 --> 00:37:26,880
Please spare them, all right?

596
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:33,280
I'm heartless?

597
00:37:37,480 --> 00:37:39,200
Because you had tuberculosis,

598
00:37:40,200 --> 00:37:43,760
I became an apprentice
at a lacquer workshop when I was only six.

599
00:37:45,200 --> 00:37:47,760
Then Father sold me into a ghost marriage.

600
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:52,560
I barely escaped with my life,
but I still came back.

601
00:37:53,520 --> 00:37:54,720
I was afraid.

602
00:37:56,040 --> 00:37:57,880
I was afraid that if I escaped alone,

603
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:01,280
you would be beaten,

604
00:38:02,240 --> 00:38:03,520
and my siblings would be sold.

605
00:38:04,480 --> 00:38:06,280
I worked myself to the bone.

606
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:11,480
I'd rather gnaw on tree bark
or cut flesh from my own body…

607
00:38:13,760 --> 00:38:15,440
than ever let any of you go hungry.

608
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:18,320
But what did you do, Mother?

609
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:20,920
You watched me get beaten and sold.

610
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:24,560
I was treated like an animal,
suffering day and night,

611
00:38:24,640 --> 00:38:27,760
yet you never told me
a single word of the truth.

612
00:38:33,680 --> 00:38:35,320
You just told me to accept my fate…

613
00:38:38,040 --> 00:38:41,600
that I was born into poverty
and destined for a life of suffering.

614
00:38:42,680 --> 00:38:44,000
You told me to endure it,

615
00:38:44,080 --> 00:38:46,560
persuade me into
sacrificing myself for your own children.

616
00:38:46,640 --> 00:38:48,080
And now…

617
00:38:51,480 --> 00:38:53,960
you're calling me heartless?

618
00:38:59,240 --> 00:39:01,760
A-Chou, I shouldn't have said that.

619
00:39:01,840 --> 00:39:04,040
I was wrong. Please forgive me.

620
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:07,280
If you feel even the slightest guilt,

621
00:39:08,720 --> 00:39:10,520
tell me the truth.

622
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:23,880
That night,

623
00:39:24,840 --> 00:39:26,560
I did drive the wolves away…

624
00:39:28,560 --> 00:39:32,560
but my child had already frozen to death.

625
00:39:33,640 --> 00:39:36,200
<i>I buried her on the mountain.</i>

626
00:40:06,120 --> 00:40:07,920
My A-Chou, I…

627
00:40:12,640 --> 00:40:13,480
A-Chou.

628
00:40:15,040 --> 00:40:16,080
A-Chou. A-Chou.

629
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:18,960
Don't cry. Don't cry.

630
00:40:19,040 --> 00:40:21,080
<i>Then I found you.</i>

631
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:46,880
I took off my coat
and wrapped you in them…

632
00:40:48,960 --> 00:40:51,440
then slipped home with you
in the dead of night.

633
00:40:53,520 --> 00:40:55,200
How did no one notice?

634
00:40:56,040 --> 00:41:00,080
To a poor family, a two-year-old child
is no more noticed than a cat or dog.

635
00:41:01,520 --> 00:41:06,120
Even their own father wouldn't look twice,
let alone outsiders.

636
00:41:07,560 --> 00:41:11,800
I said you were my own daughter,
and no one ever questioned it.

637
00:41:14,440 --> 00:41:18,160
Then where are the clothes I was wearing
and the keepsakes that came with me?

638
00:41:27,200 --> 00:41:28,280
Bitao,

639
00:41:29,800 --> 00:41:31,560
Runsheng was dead drunk.

640
00:41:32,200 --> 00:41:34,120
He didn't even wake up
when the fire broke out.

641
00:41:35,680 --> 00:41:37,120
Go see if he's awake yet.

642
00:41:37,200 --> 00:41:38,200
Yes.

643
00:41:38,280 --> 00:41:40,160
No, please don't!

644
00:41:42,440 --> 00:41:43,480
I'll tell you.

645
00:41:44,120 --> 00:41:45,880
They're hidden under
the stove at our old home.

646
00:41:48,000 --> 00:41:50,920
A-Chou, I did lie to you,

647
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:52,480
but if I hadn't took you
off that mountain,

648
00:41:52,560 --> 00:41:53,880
you would've frozen to death.

649
00:41:55,640 --> 00:41:57,800
For the sake of my saving you,

650
00:41:58,320 --> 00:42:00,360
please spare your brother and sister.

651
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:03,200
Blame me if you must. Hate me if you must.

652
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:04,680
Take it all out on me.

653
00:42:04,760 --> 00:42:06,240
They know nothing about this.

654
00:42:06,840 --> 00:42:10,160
Please spare them. I'm begging you.

655
00:42:14,080 --> 00:42:14,920
A-Chou,

656
00:42:16,360 --> 00:42:19,280
that night, I lost my daughter,

657
00:42:20,280 --> 00:42:22,720
and your parents
abandoned you on the mountain.

658
00:42:23,560 --> 00:42:25,360
They were the ones who cast you aside.

659
00:42:26,040 --> 00:42:28,960
You were fated to become my daughter.

660
00:42:29,560 --> 00:42:32,200
Yes, I was selfish back then.

661
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:33,840
I made you suffer

662
00:42:33,920 --> 00:42:37,040
through endless hardship.
I know I was wrong.

663
00:42:37,560 --> 00:42:39,520
From now on, we can all stay together.

664
00:42:40,040 --> 00:42:41,800
I'll make it up to you
a thousand times over.

665
00:42:41,880 --> 00:42:42,960
All right?

666
00:42:48,640 --> 00:42:49,640
Mother…

667
00:42:51,920 --> 00:42:55,480
for more than a decade,
I've been repaying you for saving my life.

668
00:42:56,640 --> 00:42:58,200
Was that still not enough?

669
00:43:05,040 --> 00:43:07,840
A-Chou!

670
00:43:10,120 --> 00:43:12,400
I was never your A-Chou!

671
00:43:30,920 --> 00:43:33,440
My Lord, Her Ladyship sent everyone away.

672
00:43:33,520 --> 00:43:36,160
She's been in there alone for an hour.

673
00:43:38,400 --> 00:43:39,240
Break the door down.

674
00:43:40,800 --> 00:43:42,080
But…

675
00:43:42,680 --> 00:43:43,680
Open it.

676
00:43:44,280 --> 00:43:45,120
Yes.

677
00:44:20,920 --> 00:44:22,280
Why are you still hesitating?

678
00:44:26,120 --> 00:44:28,800
I already know everything I need to know.

679
00:44:30,320 --> 00:44:33,360
Since you've made up your mind,
you should see it through.

680
00:44:36,000 --> 00:44:39,760
You need to be more decisive.

681
00:46:31,920 --> 00:46:34,280
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

682
00:46:35,440 --> 00:46:36,440
There's someone…

683
00:46:38,960 --> 00:46:40,120
I'd like you to meet.

684
00:49:02,600 --> 00:49:05,000
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
